#: title/pc5_ui.c:6956
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: VKD3D-Proton turns the game's Direct3D 12 into Vulkan. The "
"fastest, and what most games want."
msgstr ""
"PC5:s val: VKD3D-Proton gör om spelets Direct3D 12 till Vulkan. Snabbast, "
"och det de flesta spel vill ha."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6957
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: Wine's own Direct3D draws the game's DirectDraw with OpenGL."
msgstr "PC5:s val: Wines egen Direct3D ritar spelets DirectDraw med OpenGL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6958
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: DXVK turns the game's Direct3D into Vulkan. The fastest, and "
"what most games want."
msgstr ""
"PC5:s val: DXVK gör om spelets Direct3D till Vulkan. Snabbast, och det de "
"flesta spel vill ha."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6960
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Slower than Auto; try it if the game won't "
"start or draws wrong."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Långsammare än Auto; prova det om spelet "
"inte startar eller ritar fel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6962
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with Vulkan. Try it if the game draws wrong "
"with Auto; often faster than WineD3D."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D, som ritar med Vulkan. Prova det om spelet ritar fel "
"med Auto; ofta snabbare än WineD3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6963
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with OpenGL. The slowest; try it if the game "
"won't start with the others."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D, som ritar med OpenGL. Långsammast; prova det om "
"spelet inte startar med de andra."

